---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';

const toc = [
  { id: 'scope', label: 'Scope' },
  { id: 'trials', label: 'Free trials' },
  { id: 'monthly-plans', label: 'Monthly plans' },
  { id: 'annual-plans', label: 'Annual plans' },
  { id: 'duplicate-payments', label: 'Duplicate payments' },
  { id: 'custom-work', label: 'Custom work' },
  { id: 'how-to-request', label: 'How to request a refund' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund & Cancellation Policy"
  description="How cancellations and refunds work for Rachna Softech LLP product subscriptions."
  summary="Cancel any plan whenever you like, and get your money back when it's due. Plan-specific terms always take priority."
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="scope">1. Scope</h2>
  <p>
    This policy applies to payments made to {site.legalName} for subscriptions to our apps. Where a product’s plan or a signed agreement sets out
    different terms, those terms apply. If you subscribed through Google Play or the Apple App Store, cancellations and refunds are handled by that
    store under its own policies.
  </p>

  <h2 id="trials">2. Free trials</h2>
  <p>Free trials are free of charge. You are not billed unless you choose a paid plan.</p>

  <h2 id="monthly-plans">3. Monthly plans</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel a monthly plan at any time from your account or by writing to us. Your plan stays active until the end of the current billing
    month and is not renewed after that. Partially used months are not refunded, except where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="annual-plans">4. Annual plans</h2>
  <p>
    If you cancel within 7 days of your first annual payment, we refund it in full. After that, the plan stays active until the end of the paid
    term and the remaining period is not refunded, except where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="duplicate-payments">5. Duplicate or incorrect payments</h2>
  <p>If you are charged twice or charged an incorrect amount, we refund the excess in full after verifying the transaction.</p>

  <h2 id="custom-work">6. Custom and partnership work</h2>
  <p>Custom solutions and partnership work are billed under a separate written agreement, which sets out its own cancellation and refund terms.</p>

  <h2 id="how-to-request">7. How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your invoice number, the payment reference and the reason for your request. We
    acknowledge requests within 2 business days. Approved refunds are processed within 7 business days to the original payment method; the time
    taken for the amount to reach your account depends on your bank or payment provider.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
